From: You-Sheng Yang <vicamo.yang@canonical.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Oct 2024 02:27:46 +0800
Subject: UBUNTU: SAUCE: backport: move asm/unaligned.h to linux/unaligned.h

Accommodate to v6.12-rc2 commit 5f60d5f6bbc12 ("move asm/unaligned.h to
linux/unaligned.h").

